# MCP On-Demand

- Default workflows use native tools: Read, Grep, Glob, Edit, Write, Shell, Task.
- Do not call MCP tools unless the user explicitly requests them or names a specific MCP/integration.
- Learning is via gen-* skills (auto-skill-mint), not MCP memory tools.
